# A released customer may cross the next in line while stepping north, but is
# solid again as soon as that stride claims its new square.  The first worker
# parks beside the shredder; the second must remain blocked behind it.
name Printer Queue Solidifies
dim 3 4
ent shredder 0 1
ent printer 1 3
ent worker 1 2
ent worker 1 1
goal shredded 2
